{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/New_Wishlist_EN.png?t=1749058589\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Land of Symbiosis is a solo or co-op Action RPG that blends base defense, exploration, and sandbox survival in a procedurally generated alien world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle through waves of thousands of mechanical creatures, scavenge their remains, and loot the environment to craft powerful weapons, armor, and automated defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast-paced top-down combat and cooperative gameplay makes it a perfect survival experience to share with friends or brave alone,  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/survive.png?t=1749058589\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/New_Release.gif?t=1749058589\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To survive, you must navigate the hostile environments of planet Sigma Century gathering resources, crafting tools, and upgrading your equipment to fend off relentless creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drinking and eating are handled efficiently by your advanced suit technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, generating oxygen is another story. You'll need to find, harvest, and process specific elements to keep your life support system running </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/defend.png?t=1749058589\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/New_base_defense.gif?t=1749058589\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All of your technology generates electromagnetism: your suit, electrical systems, weapons, everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strangely, it appears to attract and provoke the creatures, making them hostile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unfortunately, survival is impossible without your technology. Therefore, you must construct defenses to protect your bases from frequent raids. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/outposts.png?t=1749058589\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/New_base_building.gif?t=1749058589\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your bases and outposts are vital for survival. Use them to set up defenses, generate electricity, store resources, and support your expeditions across the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And even the most efficient base can still look great, decorate it and make it your own! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/monstrous.png?t=1749058589\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/New_Boss.gif?t=1749058589\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It turns out that the scientists were not just there to collect plant samples. Some creatures appear to have been... modified? You could utilize their modifications to your advantage as you progress. Let's defeat them all, shall we?  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2874540?t=1749058589","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749058589","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749058589","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749058589","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/LoS_New_Roadmap.png?t=1749058589\" /></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/New_Wishlist_EN.png?t=1749058589\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Land of Symbiosis is a solo or co-op Action RPG that blends base defense, exploration, and sandbox survival in a procedurally generated alien world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle through waves of thousands of mechanical creatures, scavenge their remains, and loot the environment to craft powerful weapons, armor, and automated defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast-paced top-down combat and cooperative gameplay makes it a perfect survival experience to share with friends or brave alone,  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<di